     "en": "4-yearly averages: 34.50, 37.00, 39.50, 42.00, 44.50."
    },
    {
     "en": "Centre by averaging pairs: 35.75, 38.25, 40.75, 43.25."
    },
    {
     "en": "These are the trend values for 2015–2018; the first two and last two years have none."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "Centred MA: 2015: 35.75, 2016: 38.25, 2017: 40.75, 2018: 43.25"
   },
   "narration": {
